The legislative texts and footnotes in this repository are from the Pakistan Code, https://pakistancode.gov.pk,
published by the Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of Pakistan ("© Copyright 2022 - Ministry of Law and
Justice"). The site states no licence for reuse. The texts are reproduced without change to their wording; only the
arrangement (one file per section, Article or Schedule, one paragraph per line, footnotes renumbered through each
law) is Lexifina's. Reproducing and publishing matter published in the Gazette of Pakistan is not an infringement
of copyright under the Copyright Ordinance, 1962, section 57(1)(q)(i); the Ministry's consolidation and footnotes
are not expressly covered by that clause (see SOURCES.md). This repository is private; check that position before
it is made public.

The site's disclaimer: "The content available on this Website is for information purposes only, and is currently
under review. If there is any doubt or query, the users may refer to the original source i.e. the relevant Gazette
notification(s)."

